sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a

    opt State is NOT EnergyTransferStarted
        Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: The tool will wait for <Configured Transaction Duration> seconds

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = StopAuthorized, eventType = Updated)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post condition: State is StopAuthorized
